 to  it  it was i was i was grateful for the  exhaustion i was grateful for  um  the exasperation that you felt when oh  my god i have this 10 page speech  tomorrow how am i going to get this pull  this off i loved that opportunity and i  really learned so much on this  that i'll take with me for the rest of  my career yeah i loved that katy perry's  roar was adam's pump up song in this  series  do you have a pump up song  oh yeah i mean i first of all i write  pump up songs uh for a living with 30  seconds to mars uh so you know a lot of  my songs are aspirational they're not  they're i don't really have songs about  uh girls or  you know boys and girls and dads and  moms and you know uh that kind of stuff  i i really my the constant theme in my  songs is about  they're aspirational um so so you know  uh yeah i've i've got i've got a few for  sure  that's awesome well listen it was so  nice getting to talk to you  cannot wait for morbius like i need to  see it right now and the trailer just  looks so good and congratulations on  this series you nailed it thank you i  hope to see you in person soon i know i  know one day  yeah one day

